<h2> About JDS Public School</h2>
<strong>JDS Public School</strong> Varanasi, has been established as a result of vision visualized by Maj. (Retd.) S.R.Singh, to impart quality education to the children of Varanasi, at the most affordable cost.<br /><br />
<strong>JDS Public School</strong> is a coeducational English Medium School, with modern school campus, which include, well ventilated class room, state of art computer lab, well equipped Science labs, Smart Class and one of the best stocked library, The School Campus can proudly boast of having one of the best Playgrounds and a well defined transport system.<br /><br />
We believe that Academics is the epicenter of good education, but education is all around development of a child, thus; at JDS a child is exposed to the best education imparted by highly qualified teaching faculties and is also encouraged to develop his/her latent talents with the help of our extra- circular program & hobby- classes.  
<br /><br />
<h2>The Vision</h2>
<strong>JDS Public School</strong>, aims to be an institution of excellence, dedicated to producing leaders of tomorrow.
<br /><br />
<h2>The Mission</h2>
To fulfill the vision, <strong>JDS Public School</strong> provides an environment in which every student discovers and realizes his full potential. The school should attract the best talent Students, Teachers and Facilitators  from all parts of India, without any discrimination of race, religion, caste or social status.
